{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1747566250\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/Sequence_01_10.gif?t=1747566250\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EVERY STEP IS BEING WATCHED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traps are never in a hurry. They wait patiently.<br>And just when you think you\u2019re safe\u2026 they strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/Sequence_01_15.gif?t=1747566250\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>JUST WHEN YOU THINK YOU\u2019RE SAFE\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your steps are quiet\u2026 The ground feels solid\u2026 There seems to be no danger.<br>But this game has something to teach you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/Sequence_01_11.gif?t=1747566250\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OVERTHINKING IS A TRAP. SERIOUSLY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planning ahead is smart\u2026 until the game plans ahead of you.<br>Go with the flow. That\u2019s what the traps are doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/Sequence_01_13.gif?t=1747566250\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THOUGHT THAT WAS THE EXIT? HOW CUTE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It looked like an exit. It even <i>sounded</i> like one.<br>Too bad it was a platform \u2014 one that launches you straight into well-polished disappointment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/Sequence_01_20.gif?t=1747566250\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHAT\u2019S INSIDE? PROBABLY TOO MUCH \u2013 BUT LET\u2019S LIST IT ANYWAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly <strong>150 lovingly hand-crafted levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>200+ actual colors</strong> \u2013 no grayscale trickery here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Graphics so beautiful</strong>, even your GPU cries a little</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gently unfair</strong> gameplay that respects you... kind of</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spikes that move. And watch. And judge.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret paths, hidden levels, and one totally not suspicious button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May increase your heart rate, but also <strong>your problem-solving IQ</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimal UI, maximal emotions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bug? Or feature? You decide.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And yes... <strong>a few soft, squishy endings to make you feel things</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you've made it this far, you probably want to learn more about the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rule is simple: Spawn, die, respawn... and then do it all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Download now </i></strong><i>and take your first step into the challenging world of <strong>Trap Again!</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693920?t=1747566250","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/125e8c0add922eee078ea5db3c766f7a8b4b9462/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747566250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/bc45f604751a756770317c8740a3fa6ab83bb5fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747566250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/bc45f604751a756770317c8740a3fa6ab83bb5fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747566250","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1747566250\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/Sequence_01_10.gif?t=1747566250\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EVERY STEP IS BEING WATCHED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traps are never in a hurry. They wait patiently.<br>And just when you think you\u2019re safe\u2026 they strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/Sequence_01_15.gif?t=1747566250\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>JUST WHEN YOU THINK YOU\u2019RE SAFE\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your steps are quiet\u2026 The ground feels solid\u2026 There seems to be no danger.<br>But this game has something to teach you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/Sequence_01_11.gif?t=1747566250\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OVERTHINKING IS A TRAP. SERIOUSLY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planning ahead is smart\u2026 until the game plans ahead of you.<br>Go with the flow. That\u2019s what the traps are doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/Sequence_01_13.gif?t=1747566250\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THOUGHT THAT WAS THE EXIT? HOW CUTE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It looked like an exit. It even <i>sounded</i> like one.<br>Too bad it was a platform \u2014 one that launches you straight into well-polished disappointment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/extras/Sequence_01_20.gif?t=1747566250\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHAT\u2019S INSIDE? PROBABLY TOO MUCH \u2013 BUT LET\u2019S LIST IT ANYWAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly <strong>150 lovingly hand-crafted levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>200+ actual colors</strong> \u2013 no grayscale trickery here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Graphics so beautiful</strong>, even your GPU cries a little</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gently unfair</strong> gameplay that respects you... kind of</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spikes that move. And watch. And judge.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret paths, hidden levels, and one totally not suspicious button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May increase your heart rate, but also <strong>your problem-solving IQ</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimal UI, maximal emotions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bug? Or feature? You decide.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And yes... <strong>a few soft, squishy endings to make you feel things</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you've made it this far, you probably want to learn more about the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rule is simple: Spawn, die, respawn... and then do it all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Download now </i></strong><i>and take your first step into the challenging world of <strong>Trap Again!</strong></i></p>","developers":["Playthyng"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/6b5a0060deb1bcf1ce6affe055de1f49ea7d244e/header.jpg?t=1747566250","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Trap Again","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 100 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Playthyng"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693920/f396dcbf48c1fa443e0b0bab2b6